    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ここにいたんだな、灯織",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6002001090010,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "はい\r\nなんだか……外の空気が吸いたくて",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600200109/6002001090010"
  },
  {
    "id": 6002001090020,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……私たち、本当に優勝したんですね",
    "charAnim1": "sad3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600200109/6002001090020"
  },
  {
    "id": 6002001090030,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "なんだか夢のようで……まだ実感がわきません",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600200109/6002001090030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、ここまでよく頑張ったな灯織\r\n優勝は間違いなく自分自身の実力だ",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6002001090040,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……いえ、プロデューサーがいてくれたからです",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600200109/6002001090040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "これで、少しは理想の自分に近づけたんじゃないか？",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6002001090050,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……緊張して、ミスをしたところもありましたから",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600200109/6002001090050"
  },
  {
    "id": 6002001090060,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "でも、お客さんと一緒に歌って、盛り上がって\r\n一体になって……",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600200109/6002001090060"
  },
  {
    "id": 6002001090070,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "理想のライブに、すごく近づいた感じがしました",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600200109/6002001090070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6002001090080,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "優勝はしましたけど、まだまだこれからです",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600200109/6002001090080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、そうだな\r\nこれから、もっと頑張っていかなくちゃな",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6002001090090,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……プロデューサー\r\nこの後、少し時間はありますか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_angry",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600200109/6002001090090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん？　ああ、大丈夫だけど……",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6002001090100,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "でしたら、ちょっとだけ、\r\n私につき合っていただきたいんです",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600200109/6002001090100"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "effectLabel": "black2",
    "effectTarget": {
      "type": "rect",
      "width": 1136,
      "height": 640,
      "color": "000000"
    },
    "effectValue": {
      "type": "from",
      "x": 1000,
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 1000
    }
  },
  {
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "bg": "00021",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "effectLabel": "black2",
    "effectValue": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 1000,
      "easing": "easeInQuart"
    },
    "waitType": "effect"
  },
  {
    "id": 6002001090110,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "――ファイブ、シックス、セブン、ターン……",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "se": "0121",
    "voice": "produce_events/600200109/6002001090110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（何をするのかと思えば、\r\n今日やったダンスの確認とは……灯織らしいな）",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "se": "0121"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "灯織、疲れてるんだから\r\nあまり無理をするなよ",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6002001090120,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "すみません、でも忘れないうちにライブの時の\r\nミスを修正しておきたいですし",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "002",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/600200109/6002001090120",
    "charCategory": "stand_jersey"
  },
  {
    "id": 6002001090130,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "それに……ライブの時のあの感覚を忘れたくなくて",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600200109/6002001090130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だからってなあ……あまり追い込みすぎるなよ",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6002001090140,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "それはもう、性分ですから",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600200109/6002001090140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……それもそうだな",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6002001090150,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "トップアイドルになるためには\r\n今まで以上に頑張らないといけませんから",
    "charAnim1": "sad3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600200109/6002001090150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（以前のような焦りや苛立ちはもう見えない…）",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（いい顔をするようになったな、灯織）",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6002001090160,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "――プロデューサー",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600200109/6002001090160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "どうした？　もうダンスの確認は済んだか？",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6002001090170,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "いえ、そうではなくて……出会ってから今まで\r\n本当にありがとうございました",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600200109/6002001090170"
  },
  {
    "id": 6002001090180,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "プロデューサーとの活動の中で\r\n少しだけ自分が好きになれた気がします",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600200109/6002001090180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それは灯織自身の頑張りのおかげだよ\r\n俺はただ、灯織が輝けるように後押ししただけだ",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6002001090190,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "いいえ、プロデューサーがいなければ、\r\n今も私は自分を嫌ったままだったと思います",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600200109/6002001090190"
  },
  {
    "id": 6002001090200,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "だから……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600200109/6002001090200"
  },
  {
    "id": 6002001090210,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "この先も、私のプロデュースをお願いできますか……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600200109/6002001090210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、もちろんだ。次の目標はトップアイドル\r\n一緒に頑張っていこう",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6002001090220,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……ありがとうございます、プロデューサー",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600200109/6002001090220"
  },
  {
    "id": 6002001090230,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "これからも、どうかよろしくお願いします",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600200109/6002001090230"
  },
  {
    "label": "end"
  }
]